<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108004" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερῷος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Ion.
		 and 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπ-ώϊος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>: also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span> (v. infr.):—
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>upper,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στοαὶ ὑπερῷοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					3.68
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				5.10.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίπατοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ez.</u>
					42.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				42(1).126.11
			</span></i> (Epid., <span class="entity">ii A. D.</span>); [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόποι</span> (rooms)] <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				76.19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. θάλαμος,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερῷον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pel.</u>
				35
			</span></i>; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. οἶκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					14.47
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴκημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					483.110
				</span></i>
			 (Pergam., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Arat.</u>
				26
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Thess. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὑπεροῖος</span></b> , ὁ, name of a month in Perrhaebia, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				9(2).1231.8
			</span></i> (Phalanna, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>).</div>
